# game/script.rpy:1149
translate spanish ending_e_106ed66a:

    # text "You do kind of miss hanging out in Dimitri's room."
    text "La verdad es que extrañas pasar el rato en la habitación de Dimitri."

# game/script.rpy:1150
translate spanish ending_e_eea2fd04:

    # text "You didn't like interacting with his family so you'd always climb up and get in through his window on the second floor."
    text "Como no te gusta interactuar con su familia, siempre te trepas para entrar por la ventana de su habitación."

# game/script.rpy:1151
translate spanish ending_e_6adbaa43:

    # text "He hated it."
    text "Él odia que hagas eso."

# game/script.rpy:1162
translate spanish ending_e_62358232:

    # n "Fine, I'll stay over."
    n "Está bien. Me quedaré en tu casa."

# game/script.rpy:1167
translate spanish ending_e_df917d0b:

    # d "Right on."
    d "¡Eso!"

# game/script.rpy:1184
translate spanish ending_e_49c6763a:

    # n "Ugh, that sucked."
    n "Ugh, qué asco."

# game/script.rpy:1188
translate spanish ending_e_4c7bcd23:

    # n "I can't believe we ate the wall pizza too."
    n "No puedo creer que nos hayamos comido hasta la pizza de la pared."

# game/script.rpy:1190
translate spanish ending_e_201af05a:

    # d "I can't stand the sight of wasting food! I hate when my siblings do it."
    d "¡No soporto desperdiciar comida! Detesto cuando mis hermanitos lo hacen."

# game/script.rpy:1199
translate spanish ending_e_8a8fe5a6:

    # n "There were DEAD FLIES on the wall, dude. Stuck there with thousand-year-old grease."
    n "Amigo, había MOSCAS MUERTAS incrustadas en toda la grasa acumulada de la pared."

# game/script.rpy:1205
translate spanish ending_e_de87c1dc:

    # d "You practically live in the woods; I'm sure you've eaten worse."
    d "Prácticamente vives en el bosque, estoy seguro de que has comido cosas peores."

# game/script.rpy:1209
translate spanish ending_e_f39a7c58:

    # n "You're right."
    n "Tienes razón."

# game/script.rpy:1213
translate spanish ending_e_577456db:

    # n "I've had Momo's food."
    n "He probado la comida de Momo."

# game/script.rpy:1214
translate spanish ending_e_5c04bf35:

    # n "I swear the only things she knows how to make are pregnancy cravings."
    n "Todo lo que cocina parece antojo de embarazada."

# game/script.rpy:1218
translate spanish ending_e_331609bd:

    # d "You're not wrong on that front."
    d "Bueno, en eso tienes razón."

# game/script.rpy:1219
translate spanish ending_e_0e30a25e:

    # d "Here, listen to this song I wrote about Juno."
    d "Oye, escucha esta canción que escribí sobre Juno."

# game/script.rpy:1220
translate spanish ending_e_3496871d:

    # d "I'm gonna pitch it to the band this Friday. Tell me if it sucks ass."
    d "Se la enseñaré a la banda este viernes. Sé sincero y dime si es una mierda."

# game/script.rpy:1230
translate spanish ending_e_c3babbba:

    # text "Dimitri's room is where you fell in love with music."
    text "Te enamoraste de la música en la habitación de Dimitri."

# game/script.rpy:1231
translate spanish ending_e_38c5d1c7:

    # text "The days spent listening to whiny vocalists and shitty distorted guitar while doing homework. It was a miracle you even got any assignments done."
    text "Has pasado muchos días haciendo tu tarea con voces y guitarras desafinadas de fondo. Qué milagro que hayas pasado de curso."

# game/script.rpy:1232
translate spanish ending_e_4302c029:

    # text "Eventually, you and a couple of Dimitri's other friends formed a crappy little garage band called 'My Life is a Shitshow and I Can't Wipe Away the Stains', and now you're playing at some guy's basement in a couple of weeks."
    text "Tú y otras dos amistades de Dimitri formaron una bandita indie llamada «Mi Vida es Una Mierda y No Encuentro el Papel Higiénico». En un par de semanas, tocarán en el sótano de un tipo que no conoces."

# game/script.rpy:1233
translate spanish ending_e_142c8a1a:

    # text "They all roped you into doing vocals because you were good at yelling or whatever, which is apparently good for punk."
    text "Te pusieron a ti a cantar porque, según ellos, eres bueno gritando, lo que aparentemente sirve para el punk."

# game/script.rpy:1238
translate spanish ending_e_93175a63:

    # text "You were reluctant at first, claiming that you were only there for the free sodas, but now this shitty little garage band is the only time you ever feel like you're wanted."
    text "Al principio no estabas del todo convencido y solo aceptaste ser parte por las gaseosas gratis, pero debes admitir que solo te sientes querido cuando estás con ellos."

# game/script.rpy:1240
translate spanish ending_e_c7834743:

    # text "If only summer didn't end. Then things could remain exactly how they are, and how they used to be."
    text "Si el verano no se terminara, las cosas podrían seguir exactamente como son y como solían ser."

# game/script.rpy:1245
translate spanish ending_e_4e911b86:

    # text "Thankfully, Dimitri's room hasn't changed one bit."
    text "Por suerte, la habitación de Dimitri no ha cambiado en lo más mínimo."

# game/script.rpy:1251
translate spanish ending_e_00e71d89:

    # text "You look around the room and your eyes land on Dimitri's {i}Snailman and Slime Frog{/i} poster."
    text "Observas la habitación y tus ojos se posan en el póster de {i}Caracolín y Rana Baba{/i}."

# game/script.rpy:1252
translate spanish ending_e_e5e5b989:

    # text "That nerd."
    text "Qué nerd."

# game/script.rpy:1253
translate spanish ending_e_8e6a550e:

    # text "That poster is probably at least 11 years old."
    text "Ese póster debe tener al menos 11 años."

# game/script.rpy:1254
translate spanish ending_e_bd6e6cb9:

    # text "Dimitri was the one who introduced you to the show, and you remember following him home every day after school to watch the new episode."
    text "Dimitri te enseñó el programa. Volvías con él a su casa todos los días después de clase para mirar el episodio del día."

# game/script.rpy:1260
translate spanish ending_e_2746d17d:

    # text "There's the lighter you gave him in tenth grade."
    text "Ahí está el encendedor que le diste cuando estaban en la secundaria."

# game/script.rpy:1264
translate spanish ending_e_1f5b6af2:

    # text "The stop sign you toppled over when Dimitri let you take Juno for a spin."
    text "La señal de «PARE» que derrumbaste cuando Dimitri dejó que usaras a Juno para dar una vuelta."

# game/script.rpy:1266
translate spanish ending_e_f3b499b8:

    # text "Never again."
    text "Nunca más."

# game/script.rpy:1272
translate spanish ending_e_4843faef:

    # text "He even kept the cool stick you found in the woods."
    text "Aún tiene esa rama que encontraste en el bosque."

# game/script.rpy:1274
translate spanish ending_e_bcb4b40d:

    # text "Why did he tape it up like that..."
    text "¿Por qué la encintó a la pared?"

# game/script.rpy:1279
translate spanish ending_e_d4b63651:

    # text "Oh."
    text "Oh."

# game/script.rpy:1284
translate spanish ending_e_9b20f5a8:

    # text "Man, your head WAS big."
    text "Vaya, tenías la cabeza GRANDE."

# game/script.rpy:1293
translate spanish ending_e_9e3cc995:

    # n "When are you leaving?"
    n "¿Cuándo te vas?"

# game/script.rpy:1299
translate spanish ending_e_27314237:

    # d "For uni? The 27th."
    d "¿A la uni? El 27."

# game/script.rpy:1303
translate spanish ending_e_facc5c5d:

    # n "I see."
    n "Ya veo."

# game/script.rpy:1307
translate spanish ending_e_cb02081c:

    # d "Dude, don't worry 'bout that right now. We still have plenty of summer left."
    d "Amigo, no te preocupes por eso ahora. El verano aún no termina."

# game/script.rpy:1310
translate spanish ending_e_bb2cf764:

    # n "..."
    n "…"

# game/script.rpy:1313
translate spanish ending_e_59c8cd84:

    # d "Tell you what. I don't know what the future's gonna look like, but let's make this the best summer of our lives."
    d "Te diré algo. No sé que nos deparará el futuro, pero podemos hacer que este sea el mejor verano de nuestras vidas."

# game/script.rpy:1322
translate spanish ending_e_4ebd3239:

    # d "You wanna go fishing at Lost Lake?"
    d "¿Quieres ir a pescar a Lost Lake?"

# game/script.rpy:1323
translate spanish ending_e_2249c16d:

    # d "I'll grab my finest tackle."
    d "Llevaré mi mejor caña."

# game/script.rpy:1328
translate spanish ending_e_356327b5:

    # d "Wanna grab 2AM slushies?"
    d "¿Quieres beber un granizado a las 2 a.m.?"

# game/script.rpy:1329
translate spanish ending_e_9a32460d:

    # d "I'll meet you at the Junkie's parking lot 5, even 10 minutes early."
    d "Estaré esperándote en el estacionamiento de Junkie's."

# game/script.rpy:1333
translate spanish ending_e_6010fced:

    # d "Wanna get high and play Pong at my house?"
    d "¿Quieres drogarte y jugar al Pong en mi casa?"

# game/script.rpy:1334
translate spanish ending_e_131793ee:

    # d "I'll be here. Just call me."
    d "Yo estaré aquí. Solo tienes que llamarme."

# game/script.rpy:1340
translate spanish ending_e_5fa6fd40:

    # d "But for now- please, just shut the fuck up and get some sleep."
    d "Pero te ruego que ahora cierres el pico y duermas un poco."

# game/script.rpy:1346
translate spanish ending_e_e182ea20:

    # n "Okay, okay, jeez."
    n "Bueno, bueno. Dios…"

# game/script.rpy:1351
translate spanish ending_e_1f179f93:

    # text "Your last summer together, before everything changes."
    text "Su último verano juntos, antes de que todo cambie."

# game/script.rpy:1352
translate spanish ending_e_ea9a37ff:

    # text "You take in the droning sound of Dimitri's guitar playing, this precious snapshot that you know will be no more in a couple months' time."
    text "Absorbes las notas de de la guitarra de Dimitri. Sabes que no volverás a oír nada parecido por un tiempo."

# game/script.rpy:1356
translate spanish ending_e_70b25dad:

    # text "However, at this exact moment, things are exactly how they used to be."
    text "Pero, en este preciso momento, todo es exactamente como solía ser."

# game/script.rpy:1360
translate spanish ending_e_a2c1d617:

    # text "And for the first time in about a week, the sense of dread that's been following you around is not there."
    text "Por primera vez en casi una semana, ya no sientes ese terror que te ha estado persiguiendo."

# game/script.rpy:1361
translate spanish ending_e_5d0b865f:

    # text "Slowly, you finally drift to sleep."
    text "Poco a poco, comienzas a quedarte dormido."

# game/script.rpy:1367
translate spanish ending_e_92b66696:

    # "Ending (3/3): Good night"
    "Final (3/3): Buenas noches"

